{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "a3bc769e-d276-47c4-99c8-a2578f9c66d6", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 0, "ts": "2026-07-25T17:37:32.016000+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "我正在解决rebase冲突之中，上游分支更改了CONFIG_RAMBANK2_ADDR/SIZE的计算方法，但是我们的分支还用旧的方法。\n\n请你整合两者，使得在CONFIG_RK3576_DMA_ALLOC被定义时，正确地添加DMA堆的区段。没有定义时则保持原有的CONFIG_RAMBANK2_ADDR/SIZE"}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "a3bc769e-d276-47c4-99c8-a2578f9c66d6", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 1, "ts": "2026-07-25T17:37:32.015000+00:00", "role": "tool", "text": "replace_string_in_file: /home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/contest2026_062_PharosTech/chips/rk3576/include/chip.h", "tool_name": "replace_string_in_file", "tool_call_id": "db-replace_string_in_file-0", "files_touched": ["/home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/contest2026_062_PharosTech/chips/rk3576/include/chip.h"]}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "a3bc769e-d276-47c4-99c8-a2578f9c66d6", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 2, "ts": "2026-07-25T17:37:32.016000+00:00", "role": "assistant", "text": "冲突已解决。整合后的逻辑：\n\n- **`CONFIG_RK3576_DMA_ALLOC` 定义时**：DMA 堆从 `0x49400000` 开始，`CONFIG_RAMBANK2` 从 DMA 堆之后开始，大小 = DDR总大小 - OP-TEE - Bank1 - DMA堆\n- **未定义时**：保持上游的计算方式，使用 `CONFIG_RAMBANK1_ADDR + CONFIG_RAMBANK1_SIZE + RK3576_OPTEE_SIZE` 作为 Bank2 起始地址，大小用 `CONFIG_RK3576_DDR_SIZE_GB` 等宏变量计算（而非硬编码的 MB 值）\n\n这样两边都用上游的 `CONFIG_RK3576_DDR_SIZE_GB` 和 `CONFIG_RAMBANK1_SIZE` 宏，而不是你分支里旧的 `CONFIG_KICKPI_K7_DDR_SIZE_GB` 和硬编码值。"}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "a3bc769e-d276-47c4-99c8-a2578f9c66d6", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 3, "ts": "2026-07-25T17:41:20.062000+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "此处硬编码能否改成宏，你看，RK3576_DMA_HEAP_BASE应该和原先的CONFIG_RAMBANK2_ADDR位置一致"}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "a3bc769e-d276-47c4-99c8-a2578f9c66d6", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 4, "ts": "2026-07-25T17:41:20.062000+00:00", "role": "assistant", "text": "现在 `RK3576_DMA_HEAP_BASE` 和 `#else` 分支里 `CONFIG_RAMBANK2_ADDR` 使用完全相同的表达式，语义一致——DMA 堆从 Bank2 起始位置（即 OP-TEE 之后）开始。这样如果上游将来调整 `CONFIG_RAMBANK1_SIZE` 等宏，DMA 堆基址也会自动跟随。"}
